Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, bukan! Bukan begitu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.26,0:00:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku hanya ingin hidup\Ndengan damai dan bebas!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku Memulai Hidup\NSebagai Penyihir Terkuat di Dunia
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.81,0:01:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pergi sana, dasar tak berguna!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:02:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan pernah mengaku\Nsebagai anggota keluarga Gugglekars.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.30,0:02:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau bukan adikku lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.09,0:02:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Matilah telantar di hutan ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.11,0:02:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.55,0:02:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa sangka aku diusir\Nhanya dengan pakaian di badan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.34,0:02:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana statusku?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.26,0:02:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"Hermit", ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.06,0:02:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nama keluargaku berubah\Njadi nama keluarga asal mendiang ibuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.58,0:02:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku benar-benar diusir\Ndari keluarga Gugglekars.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.90,0:02:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Skill rank SSS milikku\Nbernama "Internet", ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.20,0:02:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rank SSS?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.16,0:02:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau dapat skill sampah\Ndengan rank di bawah G?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau aib keluarga kesatria!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.82,0:02:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain masih level satu,\Nperlengkapanku pun seadanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.64,0:02:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku benar-benar bisa mati kapan saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya aku bisa keluar dari rumah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.55,0:03:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Inikah dunia luar?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.27,0:03:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Luas sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.57,0:03:14.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hebat sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.34,0:03:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Udara di luar sangat segar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.03,0:03:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata pohon bisa sekokoh ini, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.25,0:03:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena aku selalu dikurung di mansion,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.18,0:03:28.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}semuanya terasa baru dan menyenangkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata cuma slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.19,0:03:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah, aku pasti bisa mengalahkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.63,0:03:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku selalu belajar\Ndan berlatih sihir di rumah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.23,0:03:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sihir Dasar:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.57,0:03:48.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Petit Ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:04:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di-Dia kuat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.51,0:04:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.82,0:04:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus pakai itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Muncullah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.70,0:04:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Internet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini adalah skill unik rank SSS\Nyang baru saja kudapat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan mengaktifkannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serang dia, Internet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.10,0:04:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ehem!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.13,0:04:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tendangan Internet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.91,0:04:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Inilah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kekuatan Internet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.13,0:05:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa dari sekian banyak skill,\Naku dapat skill enggak jelas begini?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.18,0:05:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang pantas untuk rank SSS\Nyang jauh di bawah rank G, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Batu sihir ini seharga 10 shil, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.98,0:05:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini cuma cukup untuk beli pinggiran roti.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:21.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begini,\Nbisa-bisa aku mati telantar betulan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.47,0:05:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.75,0:05:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana ini?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setidaknya,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.98,0:05:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kuharap aku tahu\Ncara menggunakan Internet ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.46,0:05:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.70,0:05:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku harus menyusun kata\Ndengan menyentuh huruf-huruf ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.70,0:05:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ini semacam kata sandi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.78,0:05:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, coba-coba dulu saja, deh.\NAkan kususun kata "Internet".
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Inter...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.10,0:05:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, mana tanda\Nbuat memanjangkan bunyi vokal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.33,0:05:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, salah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Duh, bagaimana cara hapusnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah oke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.01,0:06:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cus!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.52,0:06:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang keluar banyak tulisan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mirip daftar judul buku saja.\NApa semua ini tentang Internet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.86,0:06:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa skill ini seperti perpustakaan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.24,0:06:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin ini tidak memicu apa pun\Nkarena termasuk skill tipe informasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.44,0:06:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal aku berharap dapat skill tempur.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.01,0:06:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi untuk bepergian,\Ninformasi itu penting, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.27,0:06:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin skill ini tidak buruk-buruk amat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.10,0:06:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke. Aku akan coba cari informasi\Nyang ingin kutahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang jelas, aku butuh peta hutan ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus keluar dari sini\Nuntuk memulai sesuatu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak begitu berharap\Nkarena peta itu benda berharga,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi apa salahnya coba-coba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.98,0:06:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ippl... Eh, mana hurufnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.06,0:06:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wiki panduan dan strategi\Nuntuk menaklukkan Hutan Ipple?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.13,0:06:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa maksudnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:06:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku bisa lihat petanya di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:07:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, mana mungkin...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.14,0:07:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan isinya detail banget.\NIni setingkat rahasia negara.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.18,0:07:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah ini gawat banget?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.23,0:07:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.16,0:07:19.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, biarlah! Lihat saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.49,0:07:25.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke, oke.\NSekarang aku di sekitar sini, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.44,0:07:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.02,0:07:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada 500 shil di dekat sini?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.78,0:07:36.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, tidak.\NMasa bisa sedetail itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.33,0:07:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jumlahnya juga pas 500 shil!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan bisa tahu uang receh\Nyang dijatuhkan orang tak dikenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kok mulai seram, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa bisa tahu sedetail ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.60,0:07:57.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa sebenarnya Internet itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.54,0:08:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu! Ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.80,0:08:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain Hutan Ipple, ada peta dari\Nberbagai tempat di seluruh dunia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak hanya itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.53,0:08:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di sini juga ada daftar orang,\Ndaftar perlengkapan, dan daftar skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.98,0:08:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan, Internet adalah skill\Nyang cukup mengerikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.78,0:08:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rank-nya tidak mungkin di bawah G.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku yakin
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.42,0:08:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ini adalah skill\Nuntuk mengakses pengetahuan dewa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.18,0:08:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rak buku milik para dewa\Nyang mencatat segalanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.43,0:08:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itulah Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:33.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika aku bisa menguasainya...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.95,0:08:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lorna.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu ingin kamu hidup bebas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.05,0:08:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seperti tokoh utama dalam cerita ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.15,0:08:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.65,0:08:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maafkan Ibu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:49.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena belenggu para bangsawan,\Nkamu jadi ikut terkurung di mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.66,0:08:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun, suatu hari nanti,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kamu pasti bisa menikmati kebebasan\Ndi bawah langit luas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:09:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu harap kamu bisa\Nmelihat banyak pemandangan,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.03,0:09:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bertemu banyak orang,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.18,0:09:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan menghabiskan waktu dengan banyak tawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itulah harapan Ibu, Lorna.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kupikir aku akan terus hidup\Ndi dalam mansion seperti Ibu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.33,0:09:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.74,0:09:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jika aku memiliki skill ini,\Nmungkin aku bisa hidup bebas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.57,0:09:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.17,0:09:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}untung saja aku diusir\Nsebelum mereka tahu fungsi Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.57,0:09:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika mereka sampai tahu duluan,\Naku pasti dikurung di dalam mansion
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.63,0:09:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan dijadikan alat informasi\Nuntuk keluarga Gugglekars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lokasi kemunculan monster\Ndan posisi jebakan pun diketahui.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin Internet adalah skill\Nyang punya potensi luar biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.58,0:09:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah, aku akan belajar lebih banyak lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.72,0:09:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada banyak hal yang ingin kutahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.12,0:09:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lo-Loh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.43,0:10:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Muncul tampilan aneh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.05,0:10:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa itu "iklan"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ba-Bagaimana ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.64,0:10:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku harus tekan tanda silang ini\Nuntuk kembali ke halaman sebelumnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa ukurannya kecil banget?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.26,0:10:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lo-Loh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.37,0:10:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Waduh!\NTampilan anehnya tambah banyak!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.53,0:10:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ti-Tidak mungkin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.91,0:10:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Internetnya rusak?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah normal lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.37,0:10:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun, ternyata Internet itu\Nmudah rusak, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.11,0:10:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus hati-hati.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.20,0:10:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah cukup paham\Ncara menggunakan Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.75,0:10:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang aku bisa membuka beberapa "Jendela"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.18,0:10:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan mencari dengan "Mode Pribadi"\Nsehingga tidak bisa dilihat orang lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.12,0:10:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tidak salah,\Njalannya bercabang di dekat sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata informasi\Ndi Internet memang akurat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.41,0:11:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke! Pertama, aku akan\Ncari uang receh lebih banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.75,0:11:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Uang 500 shil belum cukup\Nuntuk menyewa penginapan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.79,0:11:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jalan rahasia?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.65,0:11:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan, ada setumpuk\Nuang receh di ujung jalan itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.97,0:11:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Coba kulihat dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.65,0:11:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Item yang bisa didapat:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tongkat Sihir Pohon Dunia,\NWand of the World?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.08,0:11:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya hebat banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini bukan nama tongkat sihir\Ndengan rank di bawah G, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa rank SSS itu berada di atas rank A?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saatnya tanya Internet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.49,0:11:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tiga tingkat di atas rank A?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.98,0:11:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa di atas rank A ada S,\Ndan di atasnya lagi ada rank SS?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.44,0:11:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Logikanya dari mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukannya mending pakai AAA\Natau pakai jumlah bintang saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.27,0:11:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, biarlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.71,0:11:50.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gara-gara rank membingungkan ini,\Naku jadi bisa keluar dari rumah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.98,0:11:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang lebih penting,\Naku harus menemukan jalan rahasianya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.22,0:11:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa di sini, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.73,0:12:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar-benar ada.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.29,0:12:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku masih tidak percaya\Nkalau tongkat sihir rank tertinggi
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.28,0:12:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bisa ditemukan di dekat sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.39,0:12:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi Internet itu kata-kata dewa.\NAku tak bisa meragukannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.34,0:12:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di mana tongkat sihirnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.19,0:12:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benda sehebat itu tak mungkin\Ntergeletak seperti uang receh, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.98,0:12:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.07,0:12:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin aku harus\Nmengucapkan kata kunci ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.21,0:12:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berhentilah waktu!\NDunia ini begitu indah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.94,0:12:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Senang bertemu denganmu, Gadis Manusia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku adalah roh Pohon Dunia, Yggdrasil.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.40,0:13:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku senang karena kamu berhasil\Nmelewati Ujian Dua Belas Bintang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.27,0:13:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ujian apa, sih?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.08,0:13:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku melewatkan banyak tahapan\Nuntuk sampai ke tempat ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.13,0:13:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Se-Sebenarnya aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.56,0:13:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak perlu dijelaskan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:23.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kata-kata tadi hanya bisa diucapkan
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.82,0:13:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}oleh orang berhati suci\Nyang berhasil menyelesaikan ujian.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.63,0:13:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Waduh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.82,0:13:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu pasti telah melewati
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.07,0:13:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}banyak petualangan\Nuntuk mencapai tempat ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mana ada.\NAku baru satu jam di luar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.04,0:13:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu pasti telah mengalami\Nbanyak pertemuan dan perpisahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku belum ketemu siapa-siapa selain dirimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.19,0:13:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena itulah,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.58,0:13:49.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku bisa mempercayakan anak ini kepadamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.98,0:13:54.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku percayakan tongkat sihir ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.33,0:13:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sekaligus dunia ini, kepada dirimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.24,0:14:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dunia?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.32,0:14:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, akhirnya,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.08,0:14:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku bisa menyusul orang itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.18,0:14:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.67,0:14:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.97,0:14:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, tunggu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.42,0:14:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kamu melayani pengembalian barang?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.94,0:14:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf! Maaf! Maaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.54,0:14:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak menyangka bakal\Ndibebani harapan sebesar ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku merasa seperti disodori bom dahsyat
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.26,0:14:33.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}berupa tugas untuk memikul nasib dunia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:36.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, lebih kuat itu lebih baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.85,0:14:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga tidak mungkin membuangnya sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.12,0:14:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, biarlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.68,0:14:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku cek status dulu, deh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.86,0:14:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}MP-ku sebanyak 99999?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.30,0:14:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Angkanya kelihatan rusak gitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.65,0:14:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata angka status itu\Nenggak mentok di 999, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.24,0:15:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan ahli sihir kerajaan saja\Ncuma punya MP sekitar 500.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.29,0:15:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.03,0:15:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku sudah menjadi yang terkuat di dunia?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.44,0:15:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku menerima tongkat sihir\Nyang jauh lebih hebat daripada dugaanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.10,0:15:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku baru kepikiran,\Nsebenarnya ini tongkat sihir apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.57,0:15:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelak saat dunia menghadapi krisis besar,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.04,0:15:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sang penyelamat akan muncul\Nsambil membawa tongkat sihir ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke.\NSebaiknya aku bermalam di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.80,0:15:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menurut Internet, tidak ada monster di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.97,0:15:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertama, siapkan api.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.85,0:15:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang aku punya banyak MP,\Njadi aku bisa pakai sihir sepuasnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.63,0:15:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sihir Dasar:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.63,0:15:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Petit Flame!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aduh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.07,0:16:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masa bisa begitu, sih?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pe-Petit Ice! Petit Ice! Petit Ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.53,0:16:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kok bisa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.91,0:16:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.26,0:16:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa gawat kalau ada orang\Nyang melihatku di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.02,0:16:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pokoknya, aku harus\Nsegera pergi dari tempat ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.93,0:16:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku hanya ingin hidup\Ndengan damai dan bebas!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.45,0:16:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.21,0:16:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Garis ley utama di Hutan Ipple\Ntelah lenyap?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.99,0:16:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keluarga Gugglekars bisa makmur
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:46.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}karena kami memonopoli\Nmana yang melimpah dari garis ley itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:49.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika Raja sampai tahu,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku harus bertanggung jawab\Natas lenyapnya garis ley!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.62,0:16:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kenapa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.72,0:16:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terdeteksi reaksi magis yang besar di sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:17:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dan MP-nya melebihi 1000.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak mungkin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.31,0:17:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika ada sosok yang bisa\Nmemakai sihir sedahsyat itu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}artinya dia adalah raja iblis\Natau semacamnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.03,0:17:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya sosok macam apa\Nyang muncul di wilayah ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.00,0:17:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sosok macam apa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.18,0:17:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sosok macam apa itu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.98,0:17:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebentar lagi aku sampai di kota.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun, sebelum itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.79,0:17:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ketemu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.34,0:17:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini titik pengumpulan bahan\Nyang tertera di peta.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.38,0:17:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa dijual seharga 50.000 shil?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.84,0:17:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak boleh dilewatkan, nih!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.41,0:17:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harganya terbilang murah\Nmeski disebut herba langka, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.17,0:17:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan ambil banyak-banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.71,0:17:49.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Borong, nih!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.21,0:17:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin segera ke kota dan makan sesuatu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:17:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, sebelum itu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:57.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ada lubang jebakan\Nbuatan goblin di tempat ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.98,0:18:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang kelihatan terlalu rapi\Nsampai tidak wajar, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.35,0:18:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, ada tiga Brown Goblin level 4\Nyang bersembunyi di semak sebelah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka pasti berencana menyerang\Nsaat aku jatuh ke dalam lubang.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.55,0:18:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, aku sudah tahu\Nsemuanya lewat Internet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.82,0:18:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terra Drain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.18,0:18:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika MP monster dikuras habis,\Nmereka akan lumpuh sementara.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.56,0:18:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat itulah...\NTadi apaan, sih?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.68,0:18:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.66,0:18:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelemahan Brown Goblin adalah elemen angin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.82,0:18:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.31,0:18:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Petit Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.74,0:18:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seperti biasa, kekuatannya dahsyat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun, sihir seperti ini\Ntidak bisa kupakai di kota.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.09,0:18:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Internet itu benar-benar hebat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.95,0:19:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan syarat menguasai skill\Ndan informasi kelemahan monster
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.96,0:19:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}yang belum diketahui pun,\Nsemuanya tertulis lengkap di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.90,0:19:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Skill bawaan lahir dianggap paling berharga
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.26,0:19:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}karena cara mendapatkannya\Nbelum diketahui sampai sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.20,0:19:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika ditemukan metode latihan\Nuntuk mendapatkan skill,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.51,0:19:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}itu akan diperlakukan\Nsebagai rahasia negara.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak bisa asal membeberkan ini
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.39,0:19:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}karena terlalu banyak\Ninformasi berharga di sini,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.43,0:19:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi aku ingin belajar bermacam-macam skill!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.71,0:19:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa pakai skill baru kan asyik!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.10,0:19:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nah, sebentar lagi,\Naku akan keluar dari hutan ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.57,0:19:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi sebelum itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.37,0:19:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih ada satu pekerjaan terakhir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.95,0:19:47.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku cukup optimis\Nkarena sudah mempelajarinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.39,0:19:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya Internet berisi informasi valid...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.69,0:19:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah mempelajarinya,\Ntapi tetap saja takut!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.11,0:20:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang jelas, kelemahannya\Nadalah elemen api dan es.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.83,0:20:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku takut pakai api\Nkarena bisa membakar hutan...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.84,0:20:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Petit Ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.70,0:20:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster level 50 memang kuat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.99,0:20:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satu serangan sihir dasar\Nbelum cukup untuk mengalahkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.65,0:20:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Itu makananku yang berharga!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.18,0:20:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Takkan kumaafkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.47,0:20:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Petit Wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.79,0:20:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu terjebak!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.95,0:20:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.78,0:20:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini adalah lubang buatan goblin\Nyang kuhindari tadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.10,0:20:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bikin banyak tembok\Nuntuk menggiringmu ke sini!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.08,0:21:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata Internet tahu apa saja, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.94,0:21:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang jelas, aku tinggal\Nmenyerang sampai kamu kalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.17,0:21:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penguasa Hutan, kamu akan jadi makananku!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.35,0:21:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Petit Ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.62,0:21:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ditambah...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.74,0:21:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lo-Loh? Sudah selesai?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.58,0:21:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya kok terlalu mudah, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.95,0:21:34.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu, apa dua serangan saja\Ncukup untuk mengalahkannya?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.17,0:21:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daya sihirku sekarang melebihi 3600.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.09,0:21:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus, setelah ditambah\Nefek Wand of the World,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.96,0:21:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kekuatan sihirku jadi 2 kali lebih besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.44,0:21:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ditambah efek Kemahiran Sihir 5,\Njadinya 1,3 kali lebih besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.66,0:21:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ditambah efek Pemangsa Raksasa 1,\Ndamagenya jadi 1,32 kali lebih besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus, karena memanfaatkan kelemahannya,\Ndamagenya jadi 2 kali lebih besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.49,0:21:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika digabungkan...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.96,0:22:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke. Pokoknya,\Naku sudah jadi cukup kuat, ya.
